 95</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Kinderfussball (F–D Junioren)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Für Anmeldungen im Kinderfussball (F–D Junioren) wende dich an unsere KIFU-Leiterin:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Jacqueline Kempf</strong> – Leiterin KIFU / F–D Junioren<br>📧 <a href=\"mailto:jacqueline.kempf-imholz@gmx.ch\">jacqueline.kempf-imholz@gmx.ch</a><br>📱 078 795 29 67</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Newsletter</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Melde dich für unseren Newsletter an und bleib immer auf dem Laufenden:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"http://eepurl.com/fcschattdorf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jetzt für Newsletter anmelden</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n','Mitglied werden','','inherit','closed','closed','','36-revision-v1','','','2026-06-26 17:34:27','2026-06-26 15:34:27','',36,'http://localhost:8080/?p=410',0,'revision','',0),(411,0,'2026-06-26 17:34:27','2026-06-26 15:34:27','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Vorstand FC Schattdorf</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":223,\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Ralph_Bomatter-200x300.jpg\" alt=\"Ralph Bomatter\" class=\"wp-image-223\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" /></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ralph Bomatter</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Präsident</strong><br><a href=\"mailto:praesident@fcschattdorf.ch\">E-Mail</a><br>M: 079 390 42 01</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=